 2x+y & =c \\\\ y & =-2x+c.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe equation above gives us a family of lines with slope of $-2.$ Therefore, the correct graph is as follows:\n\n![](images/ff/ff1117065d7475786dd6c45f71f14d78b32cb3273123ced1adf5a67b750dacdd.png)" 13194139534435 17592186045417 true] [17592186421493 1058 #edb/ref 17592186421496 13194139534435 17592186045417 true] [17592186421493 1062 #uuid "21b773b4-bd95-5150-b031-ba25c0bc0edb" 13194139534435 17592186045417 true] [17592186421493 1063 #edb/ref 17592186125014 13194139534435 17592186045417 true] [17592186421494 1058 #edb/ref 17592186421497 13194139534435 17592186045417 true] [17592186421494 1062 #uuid "35ace902-fd84-5342-8e5b-38d0d8036933" 13194139534435 17592186045417 true] [17592186421494 1063 #edb/ref 17592186262943 13194139534435 17592186045417 true] [17592186421495 1062 #uuid "6ed691e2-551c-53fd-a582-b1d42ed0b3f6" 13194139534435 17592186045417 true] [17592186421495 1063 #edb/ref 17592186387992 13194139534435 17592186045417 true] [17592186421496 1058 #edb/ref 17592186421494 13194139534435 17592186045417 true] [17592186421496 1062 #uuid "d24eeca1-18a8-58f3-b314-b346d5df791c" 13194139534435 17592186045417 true] [17592186421496 1063 #edb/ref 17592186338937 13194139534435 17592186045417 true] [17592186421497 1058 #edb/ref 17592186421495 13194139534435 17592186045417 true] [17592186421497 1062 #uuid "d88cafd9-c924-5a6c-a387-1de1666c815e" 13194139534435 17592186045417 true] [17592186421497 1063 #edb/ref 17592186421492 13194139534435 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-6a0141e2-b45c-5728-9130-9f03fb235cac" 17592186421485 "answer-5cac3057-4676-5ed3-95e8-e4e063eba65b" 17592186421486 "answer-61cd2c81-8156-5dbe-b41f-65c5a923eb06" 17592186421487 "answer-928d4148-96cc-555a-8460-275af511b8a3" 17592186421488 "answer-b23cb473-4c8b-55bf-98c3-c301ef278556" 17592186421489 "answer-ed3cc711-dc0b-5b9e-a281-a519fe0fd7e8" 17592186421490 "answer-field-6a04a0ad-4057-596b-b2f3-8b4c7bc755f2" 17592186421491 "question-ca25fed3-89e3-5069